{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "責也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "則郎切與臧同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音喜末年屬羊狶亥\n\n年屬猪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡結切將也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "都雷切治金日追玉曰琢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平祕切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "荒佩切洗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "于鬼切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "余六切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弋灼切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古回切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳥沃切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音裕呼也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左一行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "濬妄改以為對下譽\n字縱大字義不穩亦但可存古也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石八行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字彙正字通雖辨辯不分二皆\n有註寫者可从元本也"}
